# Every row below is authored for one assigned variant. Related family alternatives are excluded from its duties.
R('SF001_01','목 밑에 가까운 얕은 둥근 상의 경계','top_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.neckline.contour,wardrobe.neckline.depth','The neckline of top A forms a continuous shallow curve immediately below the same wearer\'s neck base.','top_A.neckline>curves_below>wearer_A.neck_base','Read the curved textile edge from one side to the other together with the wearer\'s neck base; the shallow gap must be visible.','A deeper scoop opening, a necklace arc or a skin shadow supplies a different boundary.')
R('SF003_01','쇄골 아래로 내려가는 넓은 둥근 목선','top_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.neckline.contour,wardrobe.neckline.width,wardrobe.neckline.depth','Top A has a broad rounded opening whose lowest edge lies below the same wearer\'s collarbones.','top_A.neckline>curves_below>wearer_A.collarbones','Read both side edges and the rounded bottom of this one opening with the collarbone landmarks.','A V point, merely wide shallow edge or neckline shadow does not establish this rounded depth.')
R('SF005_01','같은 앞판에서 뾰족하게 수렴하는 V 목선','top_A','wardrobe.neckline.contour','Two slanting textile edges of top A meet at one pointed bottom on its front neckline.','top_A.neckline.left_edge>converges_with>top_A.neckline.right_edge;;top_A.neckline.point>belongs_to>top_A.front','See both fabric edges and their single shared V point on the same front panel.','Two straps crossing or a central skin shadow is not the neckline; this variant prescribes no depth or breast exposure.')
R('SF007_01','윗선의 두 둥근 봉우리와 중앙 낮은 지점','bodice_A','wardrobe.neckline.contour','The upper boundary of bodice A has two rounded lobes joined by a shallow dip at the center.','bodice_A.upper_edge.left_lobe>meets_at>bodice_A.upper_edge.center_dip;;bodice_A.upper_edge.right_lobe>meets_at>bodice_A.upper_edge.center_dip','Trace the actual upper textile boundary across both lobes and the central dip.','Cup seams or breast outlines inside a straight upper edge do not supply this contour; strap state remains open.')
R('SF009_01','소매가 이어지는 양 어깨 아래 상의 윗선','top_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.shoulder.coverage,wardrobe.sleeve.attachment','The upper edge of top A lies below both of the same wearer\'s shoulder tops. @@ Both sleeves remain visibly joined to this lowered bodice edge.','top_A.upper_edge>lies_below>wearer_A.shoulder_tops;;top_A.sleeves>join>top_A.bodice','Show both shoulder landmarks above the fabric edge and the two sleeve-to-bodice connections.','A broad boat neck at shoulder height or an isolated missing sleeve does not show both lowered shoulders.')
R('SF010_02','어깨 위 연결부가 남는 닫힌 소매 개구부','top_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.shoulder.opening,wardrobe.shoulder.support_topology','A fully bounded cutout in top A\'s sleeve reveals the same wearer\'s shoulder. @@ A band of that sleeve fabric still crosses above the cutout.','top_A.sleeve.cutout>reveals>wearer_A.shoulder;;top_A.sleeve.upper_band>crosses_above>top_A.sleeve.cutout','Read the opening perimeter and the continuous fabric bridge above it on the same sleeve, with shoulder skin inside.','An off-shoulder free upper edge, sheer insert or painted pale patch has a different topology.')
R('SF012_02','불투명 몸판에 봉합된 투명 목선 망사','top_A','wardrobe.neckline.panel_connection,wardrobe.neckline.panel_transmission,wardrobe.neckline.mesh_structure','A transparent mesh insert spans the upper neckline of top A. @@ Its visible seam joins the mesh edge continuously to the opaque bodice below.','top_A.neckline.mesh>spans>top_A.upper_neckline;;top_A.neckline.mesh.edge>sewn_to>top_A.opaque_bodice.edge','Resolve actual mesh cells or yarn texture, transmission through the insert and its connected seam into the solid bodice.','Bare skin, a skin-colored opaque lining or an unbounded keyhole cannot replace a connected transparent textile panel.')
R('SF014_02','캐미솔 앞뒤 몸판에 붙은 좁은 어깨끈','camisole_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.strap.width,wardrobe.strap.attachment','Narrow straps of camisole A pass across the same wearer\'s shoulders. @@ Each strap joins the front and rear bodice of that one camisole.','camisole_A.straps>pass_across>wearer_A.shoulders;;camisole_A.straps.front_ends>join>camisole_A.front;;camisole_A.straps.rear_ends>join>camisole_A.back','See each strap width and both ends attached to the same camisole; a rear endpoint hidden by hair is unobservable.','A necklace, a separate inner garment\'s straps or a strap floating over the shoulder does not establish the attachment.')
R('SF015_02','한 상의의 앞뒤를 잇는 넓은 어깨끈','top_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.strap.width,wardrobe.strap.attachment','Broad flat straps of top A cover bands across the same wearer\'s shoulders. @@ Their front and rear ends attach to that same top body.','top_A.straps>span>wearer_A.shoulders;;top_A.straps.front_ends>attach_to>top_A.front;;top_A.straps.rear_ends>attach_to>top_A.back','Resolve both side edges of each broad strap and its actual front and rear garment junctions.','A sleeve cap, narrow string or straps belonging to a separate lower layer are different owners.')
R('SF017_01','목 쪽으로 들어간 앞 암홀 곡선','top_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.armhole.front_contour,wardrobe.shoulder.front_coverage','The front armhole edge of top A sweeps inward toward the neck. @@ The front shoulder of the same wearer lies outside that curved textile edge.','top_A.armhole.front_edge>curves_toward>wearer_A.neck_base;;wearer_A.front_shoulder>lies_outside>top_A.armhole.front_edge','Read the front armhole arc, its continuation into the same top and the shoulder region left outside it.','A dropped sleeve seam, a side opening or a deep lower armhole alone does not establish this inward front contour.')
R('SF018_02','넓은 암홀과 연속 앞판의 느슨한 짧은 탱크','tank_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.armhole.width,wardrobe.top.hem_height,wardrobe.fit.local_ease,wardrobe.front.continuity','Tank A has wide arm openings, a short body and an unbroken front panel. @@ Its side fabric hangs with loose folds away from the same wearer\'s torso.','tank_A.armholes>border>wearer_A.arms;;tank_A.front>connects_to>tank_A.short_hem;;tank_A.side_panels>stand_away_from>wearer_A.torso','Read both arm opening edges, the short hem and continuous front; loose side folds must belong to this tank.','Muscle definition, athletic role or a single large slit cannot replace the stated tank structure; no skin exposure below it is inferred.')
R('SF020_01','연결된 뒤판 경계가 둘러싼 오픈백','top_A','wardrobe.back.opening_topology','An open region interrupts the back of top A while connected edges of that same top frame the opening.','top_A.back.opening>bounded_by>top_A.connected_back_edges','Use a rear view to trace the actual opening perimeter and residual continuous fabric connections.','A sheer filled back panel, front neckline or merely concealed back is different; the surface behind the opening is not prescribed.')
R('SF021_02','부착부에서 물결 끝으로 퍼지는 소매','blouse_A','wardrobe.sleeve.flare,wardrobe.sleeve.free_edge_contour','The sleeve of blouse A widens outward from its bodice attachment. @@ Its free outer edge hangs in loose waves.','blouse_A.sleeve>flares_from>blouse_A.armhole_attachment;;blouse_A.sleeve.free_edge>terminates>blouse_A.sleeve','Trace the same sleeve from attached armhole edge to the broad wavy free hem.','A separate shoulder ruffle, a cuff-gathered balloon sleeve or simple body folds have different attachments.')
R('SF023_01','블라우스 위에서 가슴 아래 시작하는 코르셋','corset_A,blouse_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.corset.upper_edge_height,wardrobe.corset.waist_coverage,wardrobe.layer.order','Corset A starts below the same wearer\'s bust and encircles the waist. @@ The separate blouse A remains continuous above and behind the corset, which overlaps it on the outside.','corset_A.upper_edge>lies_below>wearer_A.bust;;corset_A>wraps_around>wearer_A.waist;;corset_A>overlaps_outside>blouse_A','See the corset upper boundary below the bust, its waist wrap and the separate blouse continuing into the overlap.','An underbust seam on a single dress, a belt or visible underside breast skin is not this two-garment relation.','The visible wrap establishes no boning material, compression force or hidden closure.')
R('SF025_01','몸통을 두르는 짧은 끈 없는 직물 밴드','top_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.bodice.length,wardrobe.strap.presence,wardrobe.bodice.wrap_continuity','A short textile band forms top A around the same wearer\'s torso. @@ Its uninterrupted upper edge is strapless and its lower edge remains separate and visible.','top_A.band>encircles>wearer_A.torso;;top_A.upper_edge>bounds>top_A.band;;top_A.lower_edge>bounds>top_A.band','Read the short upper-to-lower textile span and continuous torso wrap; visible upper boundary must carry no shoulder straps.','A long strapless dress, crop with hidden straps or horizontal print on a shirt does not supply the short band.')
R('SF026_02','각 컵의 하단을 따라가는 외부 케이싱','top_A','wardrobe.cup.visible_casing','A narrow curved casing on top A follows the lower boundary of each of its two cups.','top_A.cup_left.casing>follows>top_A.cup_left.lower_edge;;top_A.cup_right.casing>follows>top_A.cup_right.lower_edge','Resolve the two actual casing strips following their respective cup boundaries, independently of skin and cast shadows.','An isolated breast shadow, ordinary fold or horizontal underbust seam lacks the two cup-bound channels.','The casing does not prove a concealed wire, metal content, padding or support performance.')
R('SF029_01','옆선에서 버스트 가까운 끝으로 수렴하는 다트','blouse_A','wardrobe.bodice.dart_topology','A stitched dart on blouse A begins at its side seam and tapers to one short tip near the bust.','blouse_A.dart.base>starts_at>blouse_A.side_seam;;blouse_A.dart>tapers_to>blouse_A.dart.bust_adjacent_tip','See the stitched convergence, side-seam origin and terminating tip on one blouse panel.','A seam continuing down the full bodice, loose crease or skin contour is not a terminating dart.')
R('SF031_01','앞판의 작은 주름이 모인 중앙 버스트 봉제선','top_A','wardrobe.bust.folds,wardrobe.folds.center_anchor','Small fabric folds on top A converge into a stitched anchor at the center bust.','top_A.front.small_folds>converge_into>top_A.center_bust.seam','Read several fabric folds converging to one actual central seam, with the fold surfaces attached to the same front.','Crossed twist panels, a body shadow or elastic assumed from the word shirring cannot replace the fold-to-seam relation.','Elastic thread and stretch magnitude remain unverified.')
R('SF032_02','높은 상의 밑단과 아래 허리단 사이의 넓은 틈','top_A,bottom_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.top.hem_height,wardrobe.coverage.midriff_gap','The hem of top A ends high on the same wearer\'s torso. @@ A broad visible skin interval lies between this hem and the separate bottom A waistband.','top_A.hem>lies_above>bottom_A.waistband;;wearer_A.midriff.skin_interval>lies_between>top_A.hem_and_bottom_A.waistband','See both garment boundaries with uninterrupted midriff skin between them; a cropped-out waistband cannot establish the interval.','A high crop over a continuous inner layer or image cropping is a different coverage result; underside breast exposure is not required.')
R('SF033_02','연속 앞판을 중앙에 모으는 고정 매듭 외관','top_A','wardrobe.front.knot,wardrobe.front.fabric_gathering','A compact fabric knot occupies the center front of top A. @@ The adjoining front fabric stays continuous around the knot and gathers into it.','top_A.front.fabric>gathers_into>top_A.front.knot;;top_A.front.knot>belongs_to>top_A.front','Read actual interlaced knot fabric and continuity of the surrounding front panel into its gathers.','A separate ribbon bow, printed knot or split tie closure does not establish a knot on a continuous front.','Whether the knot opens as a functional closure is metadata unless demonstrated separately.')
R('SF034_03','삼각 상의 직물의 몸통 랩과 뒤 매듭','top_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.bodice.panel_shape,wardrobe.bodice.wrap_topology,wardrobe.back.tie_attachment','A triangular panel of top A wraps across the same wearer\'s torso. @@ Its two fabric ends continue around the torso and meet in a tied knot on the back.','top_A.triangular_panel>wraps_across>wearer_A.torso;;top_A.end_left>meets_in>top_A.back_knot;;top_A.end_right>meets_in>top_A.back_knot','Trace the triangular panel and both continuing ends to the same rear knot; hidden rear connections remain unobservable.','A scarf print, triangular hem on an unrelated sewn shirt or detached back bow supplies no panel-to-knot continuity.','Reuse of an actual scarf, exact fiber and manufacturing history are not established.')
R('SF035_03','위아래 직물이 남는 옆 허리 개구부','dress_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.cutout.location,wardrobe.cutout.topology','A closed-perimeter opening sits at the side waist of dress A. @@ Fabric of the same dress continues both above and below the opening.','dress_A.cutout>located_at>wearer_A.side_waist;;dress_A.cutout>bounded_by>dress_A.continuous_surrounding_fabric','Read the entire actual opening perimeter at the side waist and both residual dress bridges above and below it.','A sheer insert, skin-colored patch or free cropped hem has a different topology; the layer behind the hole remains a separate declaration.')
R('SF038_01','배꼽보다 아래인 같은 착용자의 바지 허리단','trousers_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.bottom.waistband_height','The top edge of trousers A\'s waistband lies below the same wearer\'s visible navel.','trousers_A.waistband.top_edge>lies_below>wearer_A.navel','See the actual waistband top boundary and navel landmark in the same image.','An obscured navel, camera crop or changed body proportions cannot establish the relative waistband height.')
R('SF039_02','상의 밑단 바로 아래의 작은 아래가슴 피부 영역','top_A,adult_wearer_A','wardrobe.coverage.lower_breast','A small underside-breast skin region of the declared adult wearer is visible directly below top A\'s lower fabric edge. @@ The visible textile edge belongs to that same top and remains distinct from the skin contour.','adult_wearer_A.lower_breast.skin_region>visible_below>top_A.lower_edge','Resolve the adult subject context, the exact lower-breast skin location and the same top\'s real boundary; fabric or shadow cannot be scored as skin.','An underbust seam, corset worn over a blouse, midriff skin or a cup shadow does not supply underside-breast exposure.','This one coverage result neither implies nudity elsewhere nor establishes absent hidden underwear.')
R('SF040_03','같은 착용자의 발목 부근까지 내려오는 치마','skirt_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.skirt.hem_height','The lower edge of skirt A reaches the same wearer\'s ankle level.','skirt_A.hem>reaches>wearer_A.ankles','Read the skirt hem and ankle landmarks together; loss of either to the crop prevents a pass.','A long skirt label, floor contact or a hem hidden by another garment cannot establish ankle-relative length.')
R('SF041_02','치마 옆에 놓인 하나의 실제 트임','skirt_A','wardrobe.skirt.slit_location,wardrobe.skirt.slit_count','One slit interrupts a side edge of skirt A. @@ Its two separated textile margins meet at a visible upper starting point on that side.','skirt_A.single_side_slit>interrupts>skirt_A.side_edge;;skirt_A.slit.margins>meet_at>skirt_A.slit.upper_start','Count one actual side opening and read its two margins plus common upper start; no slit height is prescribed.','An overlapping wrap panel, knife fold or printed dark stripe is not a side slit; a concealed second opening makes the count unverified.')
R('SF042_01','허리 고정점에서 겹치는 두 치마 앞판','skirt_A','wardrobe.skirt.overlap,wardrobe.skirt.closure_attachment','A front panel of skirt A crosses over its other front panel. @@ The upper crossing panel visibly attaches to the same skirt at the waistband.','skirt_A.front_panel_outer>overlaps_outside>skirt_A.front_panel_inner;;skirt_A.front_panel_outer.upper_end>attaches_to>skirt_A.waistband','See two distinct textile boundaries with their overlap order and the outer panel\'s actual waist attachment.','A diagonal printed stripe, free slit or loose scarf draped nearby lacks the two-panel attachment.','Visible attachment does not establish an adjustable closure or how far the skirt opens while walking.')
R('SF044_01','짧은 치마의 허리에서 밑단으로 이어진 반복 플리츠','skirt_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.skirt.pleats,wardrobe.skirt.hem_height','Repeated folded pleats of skirt A begin at its waistband and continue toward the hem. @@ The short skirt hem lies above the same wearer\'s knees.','skirt_A.pleats>continue_from>skirt_A.waistband;;skirt_A.pleats>extend_toward>skirt_A.hem;;skirt_A.hem>lies_above>wearer_A.knees','Trace several actual folded ridges from the waist to the short hem and read the knee landmarks.','Printed stripes, gathered wrinkles or a long pleated skirt do not satisfy this selected short waist-to-hem arrangement.','The short hem is an authored visible variant, not a universal named-style length in centimeters.')
R('SF045_02','밑단 쪽에서 꽃잎처럼 겹치는 곡선 앞판','skirt_A','wardrobe.skirt.front_overlap,wardrobe.skirt.hem_contour','Two curved front panels of skirt A cross over one another toward the lower edge like overlapping petals.','skirt_A.front_panel_left>overlaps>skirt_A.front_panel_right;;skirt_A.front_panels.curved_edges>continue_toward>skirt_A.hem','Resolve both curved free textile boundaries and their actual layer order down toward the hem.','A single rounded skirt silhouette, bubble hem or floral print lacks two overlapping petal edges.')
R('SF047_02','양쪽 쇼츠 밑단에 이어진 불규칙한 올풀림','shorts_A','wardrobe.hem.finish,wardrobe.textile.visible_twill','The twill-like surface of shorts A ends at two uneven lower openings. @@ Frayed yarn ends project directly from both actual hem boundaries.','shorts_A.hem_left.frayed_yarns>continue_from>shorts_A.hem_left;;shorts_A.hem_right.frayed_yarns>continue_from>shorts_A.hem_right','Resolve both leg openings and individual yarn ends rooted in the irregular hems; assess surface only.','A fray print, unrelated fringe or tears above a clean hem do not establish rooted hem yarns.','Denim fiber identity and the history of cutting full-length jeans remain metadata.')
R('SF048_02','양 허벅지를 따르며 중간 높이에서 끝나는 쇼츠','shorts_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.shorts.fit,wardrobe.shorts.hem_height','Both legs of shorts A follow the same wearer\'s thigh contours closely. @@ Their separate hems end around mid-thigh.','shorts_A.legs>follow_closely>wearer_A.thighs;;shorts_A.hems>end_at>wearer_A.mid_thigh','Read fabric continuity against both thigh contours and each hem relative to the thigh span.','Loose shorts, one tight leg or a cropped image without both hems is a different fit-and-length result.','The image does not establish stretch percentage, pressure or sports performance.')
R('SF049_03','하나의 하의에서 갈라지는 두 넓은 바짓단','trousers_A','wardrobe.pants.leg_width,wardrobe.pants.branch_topology','Two broad legs branch from the shared upper body of trousers A. @@ Each leg widens toward its own separate hem.','trousers_A.leg_left>branches_from>trousers_A.upper_body;;trousers_A.leg_right>branches_from>trousers_A.upper_body;;trousers_A.legs>widen_toward>trousers_A.separate_hems','Read the shared garment branch and two distinct wide leg outlines with separate lower openings.','A single skirt tube, loose skirt folds or a second garment supplies no two-leg branching; absolute length remains open.')
R('SF050_03','몸통을 가볍게 따르는 드레스의 작은 느슨한 주름','dress_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.fit.local_contact,wardrobe.folds.local_drape','Dress A follows the same wearer\'s torso with small loose folds interrupting its surface.','dress_A.torso_panel>follows_with_soft_folds>wearer_A.torso','See the dress panel follow the torso outline while small fabric folds remain locally slack and distinguishable from body shading.','A uniformly taut panel, a rigid stand-away shell or body contour without visible cloth does not establish this local drape.','Pressure, comfort, exact ease and bodily dimensions remain unmeasured.')
R('SF051_02','자연 허리에서 같은 드레스를 모으는 별도 벨트','belt_A,dress_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.waist.gathering,wardrobe.belt.placement,wardrobe.layer.order','Belt A crosses around dress A at the same wearer\'s natural waist. @@ Fabric of that dress converges inward beneath the visible belt.','belt_A>encircles_at>wearer_A.natural_waist;;belt_A>overlaps_outside>dress_A;;dress_A.waist_fabric>gathers_under>belt_A','Read the belt as a separate continuous object over the dress and the local fabric convergence at the waist.','A printed belt, dark shadow or body narrowing without a visible gathering device lacks this relation.','Fabric gathering does not imply a change in actual waist size, pressure or comfort.')
R('SF053_01','몸통과 다리 옆으로 곧게 내려오는 드레스 외곽','dress_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.silhouette.contour','The lateral edges of dress A descend in a nearly straight outline beside the same wearer\'s torso and legs.','dress_A.side_edges>descend_beside>wearer_A.torso_and_legs','Read both dress side outlines over the torso-to-lower-skirt span; the near-straight contour must belong to cloth.','A lower flared skirt, a rectangular background panel or a changed body shape supplies a different contour.','This visible column-like outline does not prove tightness, body measurements or a specific fiber.')
R('SF054_02','자연 허리보다 낮은 몸판과 치마 연결선','dress_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.waist_seam.height','A continuous seam of dress A joins its long bodice to the skirt below the same wearer\'s natural waist.','dress_A.bodice.lower_edge>joins>dress_A.skirt.upper_edge;;dress_A.waist_seam>lies_below>wearer_A.natural_waist','Trace the true bodice-skirt junction with the same wearer\'s waist landmark above it.','A low trouser waistband, ornamental belt or seam on a separate overlay is a different owner and connection.')
R('SF056_01','작고 촘촘한 루프가 보이는 니트 면','knit_top_A','wardrobe.textile.loop_scale,wardrobe.textile.loop_spacing','The surface of knit top A consists of small closely spaced yarn loops that remain individually visible.','knit_top_A.small_loops>repeat_across>knit_top_A.surface','At native resolution resolve individual small loop contours and their close spacing across the same fabric area.','A smooth blurred knit label, printed microdots or random grain cannot supply yarn-loop continuity.','Exact needle gauge, stretch percentage, fiber content and tactile softness remain metadata.')
R('SF057_02','실 경로 사이의 실제 열린 니트 구멍','knit_garment_A','wardrobe.textile.openwork_topology','Open stitches of knit garment A leave clear gaps bounded by connected yarn paths. @@ The opaque yarn and the surface visible through each true gap remain distinct.','knit_garment_A.yarn_paths>bound>knit_garment_A.open_gaps;;knit_garment_A.open_gaps>reveal>declared_under_surface_A','Resolve continuous connected yarn around multiple true open cells and distinguish the underneath surface from the opaque yarn.','Printed diamonds, a dark flat patch or a transparent filled panel has a different structure.','The underneath surface must be independently declared; gaps do not imply skin, missing lining or fiber identity.')
R('SF059_02','자연 허리 부근에서 끝나는 카디건 밑단','cardigan_A,wearer_A','wardrobe.cardigan.length','Cardigan A\'s lower textile boundary ends near the same wearer\'s natural waist.','cardigan_A.hem>ends_near>wearer_A.natural_waist','Read the actual cardigan hem together with the natural waist landmark; identify it apart from an inner top hem.','A short image crop, blouse hem or long cardigan folded out of view cannot establish this length.','Front closure state, underwear, midriff visibility and exact hem centimeters remain open.')
